For your inflate deployment specifically — the immediate fix is to set a low-priority PriorityClass on it and reduce its requests to match the size of one real workload pod. That alone will cause Karpenter to provision correctly-sized nodes instead of over-sized ones, and real pods will evict the inflate pods on demand.



